00:34:09,964 --> 00:34:14,384
鷹嶺くんはなんか最近ハマってるゲームとかあるの？
Takane-kun, do you have any games you're into lately?

266
00:34:14,764 --> 00:34:15,564
ハマってるゲームあります。
I do have a game I'm into.

267
00:34:15,204 --> 00:34:22,164
[Text: 最近ハマっているゲーム]
[Text: Games I'm Currently Into]

268
00:34:15,564 --> 00:34:22,164
あの、最近ってわけでもないんですけど、事務所に入ってからドラゴンクエストというゲームに出会いまして、
Well, not necessarily just recently, but ever since joining the agency, I discovered a game called Dragon Quest,

269
00:34:22,304 --> 00:34:24,544
あー！ドラゴンクエスト！
Ah! Dragon Quest!

270
00:34:24,754 --> 00:34:31,964
ナンバリング1から11までやっていて、派生とかもあるので、本当に面白くてですね、大好きです。
and I've played numbered entries 1 through 11, plus spin-offs, so it's genuinely so much fun and I love it.

271
00:34:32,534 --> 00:34:35,854
そのドラクエの、どんなところが魅力？
What makes Dragon Quest so appealing to you?

272
00:34:35,964 --> 00:34:48,404
魅力たくさんあるんですけど、本当に人生の教科書だなーって思うことが結構多くて、もちろん悲しいこともあるんですけど、それを仲間たちと支え合って前に進んでいくパワーと、
There are so many appeals, but there are quite a few times when I think of it as a true textbook for life. Of course there are sad moments, but the power to support one another with comrades and push forward...

273
00:34:43,164 --> 00:34:47,364
[Title: ドラゴンクエストは人生の教科書]
[Title: Dragon Quest is a Textbook for Life]

274
00:34:48,564 --> 00:34:53,164
ナンバリングが進んでいくにつれてわかる真実とかがあったりとか、
and as the numbered entries progress, certain truths come to light,

275
00:34:53,354 --> 00:34:56,454
長年愛されてる理由が詰まってるなって感じますね。はい。
so I really feel like it's packed with reasons why it's been loved for so many years. Yes.

276
00:34:58,314 --> 00:35:00,104
じゃあ、ゲーム以外のも…
Well then, besides games...

277
00:35:00,112 --> 00:35:03,332
あ、なんか、ドラクエのそういうイベントとか行ったりしてるの？
Ah, do you go to events and things like that for Dragon Quest?

278
00:35:03,512 --> 00:35:14,712
はい、行ってますね。ドラクエのテーマパークだったりとか、あとは限定ショップに行ったりとか、あとはアニメもあるので、あの、ファンの人と同時視聴とかしたりしてましたね。はい。
Yes, I do. I go to Dragon Quest theme parks, limited-time shops, and since there's an anime too, um, I've done watch-alongs with fans and things like that. Yes.

279
00:35:15,172 --> 00:35:16,652
充実してんね！
You're really living it up!

280
00:35:16,872 --> 00:35:17,712
はい、充実してます。
Yes, I'm living my best life!

281
00:35:18,112 --> 00:35:27,852
そんなドラクエ大好きな鷹嶺ルイさんには、これからアニメ『ドラゴンクエスト ダイの大冒険』の初代オープニング「生きるをする」を披露していただきます！
And now, for Takane Lui-san, who loves Dragon Quest so much, she will perform the first opening theme "Ikiru o Suru" from the anime Dragon Quest: The Adventure of Dai!

282
00:35:28,232 --> 00:35:30,552
はい！それは楽しみだなー。
Yay! I'm so looking forward to it.

283
00:35:30,552 --> 00:35:31,012
楽しみですね。
Me too.

284
00:35:31,132 --> 00:35:35,492
はい、特別な演出にも注目してくれると嬉しいです。
Yes, I'd be happy if you also pay attention to the special staging.

285
00:35:35,952 --> 00:35:37,812
はい、それではスタンバイお願いします！
All right, then please stand by!

286
00:35:37,812 --> 00:35:41,312
はい、よろしくお願いします！
Yes, looking forward to it!

287
00:36:08,632 --> 00:36:12,492
僕が僕を愛し抜くこと
Loving myself all the way to the end...

288
00:36:12,812 --> 00:36:17,212
なあ、まだ信じてもいいか？
Hey, can I still believe in myself?

289
00:36:17,492 --> 00:36:21,152
どこへ向かう旅だとしても
No matter where this journey leads...

290
00:36:22,052 --> 00:36:25,672
[Title: 生きるをする]

291
00:36:30,212 --> 00:36:32,892
あれ、いつからだ、本音が弱音になったな
Huh, since when did my true feelings turn into mere complaints?

292
00:36:33,312 --> 00:36:39,172
逃げないことが強さになったんな
Believing that never running away equals strength...

293
00:36:39,572 --> 00:36:46,392
なあ、見つからない？自信じゃなく自分自身
Hey, can't you find it? Not confidence, but your very self.

294
00:36:47,512 --> 00:36:51,692
きっとまだ探せてない忘れものがあるはず
Surely there must be something left behind we haven't found yet.

295
00:36:52,012 --> 00:36:56,292
ずっとまだ伝えれてない伝えたい言葉
Words we've never been able to convey all this time.

296
00:36:56,692 --> 00:37:01,132
見ててくれるなら見せてみせるのに
If you're going to watch me, I'll show you...

297
00:37:01,792 --> 00:37:06,192
僕が僕を愛し抜くこと
Loving myself all the way to the end...

298
00:37:06,912 --> 00:37:11,092
なあ、まだ信じてもいいか？
Hey, can I still believe in myself?

299
00:37:11,292 --> 00:37:15,452
くすぶるのは、ちゃんと燃えたからだ
The reason it smolders is because it burned properly.

300
00:37:15,592 --> 00:37:20,432
どこへ向かう旅だとしても
No matter where this journey leads...

301
00:37:20,792 --> 00:37:28,232
ただ、目を開いて夢を見る夢を知る
Just open your eyes, dream a dream, and know what dreaming is.

302
00:37:35,372 --> 00:37:37,452
よう、生きてるかい？
Yo, are you alive?

303
00:37:37,752 --> 00:37:42,592
本当の強さきみだけが分かっていればいいのさ
True strength is something only you need to understand.

304
00:37:42,852 --> 00:37:50,912
逃げたり傷ついた数だけ居場所は増えたりする
The places you belong increase with every time you run or get hurt.

305
00:38:00,872 --> 00:38:04,812
見ててくれ 姿じゃなく生き方を
Watch me—not my appearance, but how I live my life.

306
00:38:07,472 --> 00:38:11,712
僕が僕を愛し抜かなきゃ
If I don't love myself all the way to the end...

307
00:38:12,072 --> 00:38:20,552
終わらない聖者の行進、悲しみの縫い目に投げキッス
An endless procession of saints, blowing a kiss to the seams of sorrow.

308
00:38:20,952 --> 00:38:25,352
どこへ向かう旅でも行こうぜ
Wherever this journey goes, let's go!

309
00:38:26,532 --> 00:38:29,952
まだ手を取り合って
Still holding hands...

310
00:38:31,852 --> 00:38:36,632
脳、映像、スカイはグレー、夜を駆ける
Brain, video, the sky is grey, running through the night.

311
00:38:37,592 --> 00:38:44,972
末の間、終幕、裏切りは愛のおまけ
Between the moments, the finale, betrayal is just a bonus of love.

312
00:38:45,152 --> 00:38:52,072
かさぶたになる日々 美しくはないのさ
Days that turn into scabs aren't beautiful.

313
00:38:52,292 --> 00:39:00,332
腰に巻いた正義の切れ味はどんなだ
How sharp is the justice wrapped around your waist?

314
00:39:00,732 --> 00:39:05,852
僕らは違う痛みを生きる
We live through different pains.

315
00:39:15,972 --> 00:39:20,092
勇敢でいたい、立ち向かいたい
I want to be brave, I want to stand and face it.

316
00:39:20,312 --> 00:39:25,712
眠っていたストーリーを凄いスピードで表したいんだ
I want to express the sleeping story at incredible speed!

317
00:39:27,112 --> 00:39:31,312
僕が僕を愛せる強さを
The strength to love myself...

318
00:39:31,612 --> 00:39:35,672
かなり愛してもいいか？
Can I love it quite a bit?

319
00:39:35,912 --> 00:39:40,052
くすぶるのは、燃えカスになるまで
The smoldering will last until it becomes ash.

320
00:39:40,412 --> 00:39:45,372
どこへ向かう旅だっていいさ いいのさ
No matter where this journey goes, it's fine, it's fine.

321
00:39:45,572 --> 00:39:50,632
ただ、目を見開いて息をする
Just wide open eyes, taking a breath.

322
00:39:54,012 --> 00:39:59,132
生きをする
Living life...

323
00:40:11,297 --> 00:40:12,777
続いてはおにけんです。
Next is Oniken.

324
00:40:13,177 --> 00:40:15,617
よろしくおねがいします！お願いします！おにけん！
Pleased to meet you! Please take care of us! Oniken!

325
00:40:16,337 --> 00:40:19,057
前回に引き続いてもう二人は仲がいいね。
Continuing from last time, the two of you get along so well.

326
00:40:19,517 --> 00:40:20,217
はい！
Yes!

327
00:40:20,217 --> 00:40:21,037
仲いいですよ。
We get along.

328
00:40:21,457 --> 00:40:23,297
空気もぴったりだ。
The chemistry is spot on.

329
00:40:23,297 --> 00:40:24,017
はい。
Yes.

330
00:40:24,077 --> 00:40:25,937
なきりさんは今日シュークリーム食べた？
Nakiri-san, did you eat cream puffs today?

331
00:40:26,237 --> 00:40:29,137
今日はね、まだ食べてないんですよ。でもお弁当食べました。
Today, you know, I haven't eaten yet. But I ate a bento.

332
00:40:29,597 --> 00:40:31,797
お弁当ね、おいしかったからね。
The bento was delicious, you know.

333
00:40:31,797 --> 00:40:32,677
おいしかったです。
It was delicious.

334
00:40:33,497 --> 00:40:36,637
はい、私たちも後で食べましょうね、ポルさんに。
Yes, let's eat later too, Pol-san.

335
00:40:36,857 --> 00:40:37,557
そうだね。
That's right.

336
00:40:37,757 --> 00:40:38,997
お腹ペコペコだからね。
Because we're starving.

337
00:40:38,997 --> 00:40:39,797
そうだね。
That's right.

338
00:40:40,017 --> 00:40:43,857
え、そして何やらお二人は私たちMCに聞きたいことがあるらしいですよ。
And apparently, the two of you have something you want to ask us, the MCs.

339
00:40:44,297 --> 00:40:44,817
はい。
Yes.

340
00:40:44,957 --> 00:40:45,397
なになに？
What, what?

341
00:40:46,097 --> 00:40:54,017
いやこうやってミュージックガーデンやってますけど、お二人はなんか歌いたいってなってないですか？歌いたい！みたいな。
Well, we're doing Music Garden like this, but don't you two feel like singing? Like "I want to sing!"

342
00:40:54,557 --> 00:40:54,837
え？
Eh?

343
00:40:55,257 --> 00:40:56,037
歌いたい？
Want to sing?

344
00:40:56,577 --> 00:40:57,977
まあ、多少ね。
Well, somewhat.

345
00:40:59,317 --> 00:41:03,077
口ずさんだり、体を動かしたりするけどね。
We hum or move our bodies, though.

346
00:41:04,277 --> 00:41:05,857
MCだからね。
Because we're the MCs.

347
00:41:06,077 --> 00:41:07,817
ねー、はい、MCなので。
Right, yes, since we're the MCs.

348
00:41:08,337 --> 00:41:08,637
ほう。
Oh.

349
00:41:09,157 --> 00:41:12,497
じゃあ、本当歌って踊りたいて歌っていいすか？え？
Then, can we really sing and dance and say we want to sing? Eh?

350
00:41:12,797 --> 00:41:15,997
いや、みなさんのいいパフォーマンス見てたらね。
Well, after watching everyone's great performances.

351
00:41:16,217 --> 00:41:16,697
おおー！
Ooh!

352
00:41:17,377 --> 00:41:17,917
じゃあ！
Then!

353
00:41:18,297 --> 00:41:21,117
じゃあね、ねえ、踊って歌いましょうか？
Then, hey, shall we sing and dance?

354
00:41:21,277 --> 00:41:22,657
はい、じゃあ立っていただいて。
Yes, then please stand up.

355
00:41:22,757 --> 00:41:26,637
いや私はいいよ。いやいいから立っていただいて。
No, I'm good. No, please stand up.

356
00:41:26,897 --> 00:41:30,357
あっち側であの衣装を着替えていただいていいですか？
Can you go over there and change into those outfits?

357
00:41:30,397 --> 00:41:32,557
はい！じゃあすぐ行く、すぐ行く、すぐ行って。
Yes! Then we'll go right away, go right away, go right away.

358
00:41:32,557 --> 00:41:33,337
いってらっしゃい！
Have a good time!

359
00:41:33,457 --> 00:41:35,397
じゃあスタンバイしに行ってくださーい。
Go standby, please.

360
00:41:35,497 --> 00:41:37,417
はーい！じゃあね、こちらで一旦CMでーす。
Okay! Well, we'll take a commercial break here.

361
00:41:37,837 --> 00:41:38,997
あ、それ私のセリフ。
Ah, that's my line.

362
00:41:40,497 --> 00:41:41,937
おい、準備できたかな？
Hey, are you ready?

363
00:41:41,937 --> 00:41:44,977
大丈夫かな？着替えてなんかあったんで着替えましたけども。
Are you okay? We had something, so we changed clothes.

364
00:41:45,377 --> 00:41:47,397
じゃあね、私たちも行きましょうか。
Well, shall we go too?

365
00:41:47,397 --> 00:41:47,957
行きましょう行きましょう。
Let's go, let's go.

366
00:41:48,157 --> 00:41:50,257
はい、じゃあポルさん、カンペ読んでください。
Yes, then Pol-san, please read the cue card.

367
00:41:51,417 --> 00:41:57,237
それでは聞いてください。おにかん＋ふぶぽるで「チャンカパーナ」！
Now, please listen. "Chankapana" by Onikan + Fubupol!

368
00:42:29,677 --> 00:42:35,537
深夜バスで君を見た 息を呑むような黒髪
I saw you on the midnight bus, breath-taking jet-black hair

369
00:42:35,697 --> 00:42:42,377
行き先は違うけれど オレは迷わず飛び乗る
Even though our destinations are different, I jumped on without hesitation

370
00:42:42,937 --> 00:42:51,337
一人じゃ悲しすぎる夜さ 誰かと話したかった
It's a night too sad to be alone, I wanted to talk to someone

371
00:42:51,757 --> 00:42:58,777
君もうれしそうで どちらからともなく 手を握る
You looked happy too, and before either of us knew, we held hands

372
00:43:00,017 --> 00:43:03,277
Baby チャンチャンチャンカパーナ チャンカパーナ
Baby, Chanchanchankapana, Chankapana

373
00:43:03,417 --> 00:43:07,217
痛いほど君が欲しいよ
I want you so much it hurts

374
00:43:07,217 --> 00:43:13,657
もう ジン ジン 燃えている 身体は止まらない
My body is burning, zining-zining, and it won't stop

375
00:43:13,997 --> 00:43:17,917
Baby チャンチャンチャンカパーナ チャンカパーナ
Baby, Chanchanchankapana, Chankapana

376
00:43:18,117 --> 00:43:22,077
頷いた君抱きしめた
I nodded and held you tight

377
00:43:22,077 --> 00:43:28,957
恥らうその瞳 狂ってしまいそう
That bashful gaze of yours, it's driving me crazy

378
00:43:29,417 --> 00:43:36,817
夜の吐息のなか チャンカパーナ チャンカパーナ
Amidst the sigh of the night, Chankapana, Chankapana

379
00:43:40,857 --> 00:43:47,337
バスを捨てて二人は 眠れる場所を探した
Leaving the bus behind, the two of us searched for a place to sleep

380
00:43:47,817 --> 00:43:54,697
うやうやしく服を脱ぎ ベッドに滑り込む花
Reverently taking off our clothes, flower slipping into bed

381
00:43:54,957 --> 00:44:03,177
この世にも天使がいたのさ その肌に触れたんだ
There were angels in this world too, I touched that skin

382
00:44:03,477 --> 00:44:10,217
「恋って好き」なんて悪態に言うから 舞い上がる
Saying things like "love is like liking", making me soar

383
00:44:11,057 --> 00:44:14,597
舞い上がる Baby チャンチャンチャンカパーナ チャンカパーナ
Soaring high, Baby, Chanchanchankapana, Chankapana

384
00:44:15,237 --> 00:44:19,077
人生で一番美味しいもの
The most delicious thing in life

385
00:44:19,077 --> 00:44:26,617
そう ナン ナン 何度だって 君を抱いていたい
Yes, num-num, no matter how many times, I want to hold you

386
00:44:26,757 --> 00:44:30,397
Baby チャンチャンチャンカパーナ チャンカパーナ
Baby, Chanchanchankapana, Chankapana

387
00:44:30,397 --> 00:44:34,077
まだまだ君が足りないよ
It's still not enough of you

388
00:44:34,077 --> 00:44:41,197
艶やかな果実 狂ってしまいそう
Lustrous fruit, it's driving me crazy

389
00:44:41,577 --> 00:44:48,397
夜よ覚めないでくれ チャンカパーナ チャンカパーナ
Night, please don't wake up, Chankapana, Chankapana

390
00:44:53,757 --> 00:45:00,072
美しい恋にする 美しい恋にするよ 美しい恋にするから 約束するよ、チャンカパーナ
We'll make it a beautiful love, we'll make it a beautiful love. Because we'll make it a beautiful love, I promise you, Chankapana

391
00:45:00,192 --> 00:45:02,222
美しい恋にするから 約束するよ チャンカパーナ
I'll make it a beautiful romance, I promise, Chankapana!

392
00:46:36,222 --> 00:46:40,922
[Title: Project "L"]

393
00:46:49,072 --> 00:46:51,572
[Title: 鷹嶺ルイ 1st Album]
[Title: Takane Lui 1st Album]

394
00:46:53,072 --> 00:47:01,572
[Title: 鷹嶺ルイ 1st Album Liberty] [Text: 各種サイトで好評配信中]
[Title: Takane Lui 1st Album Liberty] [Text: Now on sale across various sites]

395
00:47:14,444 --> 00:47:19,504
鷹嶺ルイ生誕3Dライブを見ている諸君 お初にお目にかかる
To all of you watching Takane Lui's birthday 3D live, I make my acquaintance.

396
00:47:20,244 --> 00:47:26,064
私はゼロ 黒の騎士団の総帥にして 世界への反逆者
I am Zero, Supreme Commander of the Black Knights and rebel against the world.

397
00:47:27,124 --> 00:47:31,004
ここまでのMガデではどうだったかな? 大いに盛り上がったことだろう
How was M-Gade up to this point? It must have been quite exciting.

398
00:47:32,564 --> 00:47:36,584
ほー だがまだ足りないな
Hmph. But that is still not enough.

399
00:47:36,784 --> 00:47:41,284
諸君らならまだまだ盛り上がるはずだ 高嶺ルイの歌によってな!
You all should be able to get even more hyped—through Takane Lui's songs!

400
00:47:42,404 --> 00:47:49,104
ヌルーシブブリタニアが命ずる 高嶺ルイよ コードギアス的主題歌メドレーで さらに盛り上げるのだ!
Lelouch vi Britannia commands you: Takane Lui, hype them up even further with a Code Geass theme song medley!

401
00:47:56,304 --> 00:47:58,144
Yes, Your Highness.

402
00:48:04,572 --> 00:48:09,572
[Title: コードギアス 反逆のルルーシュ]
[Title: Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion]

403
00:48:10,099 --> 00:48:16,969
自分を 世界さえも 変えてしまえそうな 瞬間は いつもすぐそばに...
The moment that seems like it could change yourself, even the world, is always right by your side...

404
00:48:24,569 --> 00:48:30,639
隠せぬ苛立ちと 立ち尽くす自分を見つめ
Staring at myself standing still with frustration I can't hide,

405
00:48:37,569 --> 00:48:45,379
迷いながら 悩みながら 悔やみながら 決めればいいさ
it's fine to decide while getting lost, while worrying, while feeling regret.

406
00:48:46,149 --> 00:48:52,559
君がくれた 言葉ひとつ 戸惑いは消え去りに
Every single word you gave me cleared away the hesitation,

407
00:48:53,329 --> 00:48:59,299
からっぽだった 僕の部屋に 光が射した
light shone into my empty room.

408
00:48:59,889 --> 00:49:06,669
見上げた大空が 青く澄み切って行く
The vast sky I looked up at is turning a clear, bright blue.

409
00:49:07,069 --> 00:49:12,429
閉ざした窓を 開くことを決めた
I decided to open the closed window.

410
00:49:13,059 --> 00:49:20,199
自分を 世界さえも 変えてしまえそうな 瞬間は いつもすぐそばに...
The moment that seems like it could change yourself, even the world, is always right by your side...

411
00:49:49,269 --> 00:49:59,239
夢見てた 夢 果て無き遠く 乾いた日々の 空色・手の中
Dreaming a dream, endlessly far away, in the sky-colored palms of these parched days...

412
00:50:00,180 --> 00:50:03,580
乾いた日々の 空色・手の中
Within the dry days, in the sky-blue hands...

413
00:50:05,180 --> 00:50:08,280
等間隔 音の中で 試行錯誤
Trial and error amidst evenly spaced sounds,

414
00:50:09,180 --> 00:50:14,280
時間・間隔の無い空間 ah
In a space without time or intervals, ah...

415
00:50:15,280 --> 00:50:20,480
等身大 音をたてて 僕の顔 造ってゆく
Making noise lifesize, building my own face.

416
00:50:21,280 --> 00:50:24,480
キレイに、片方だけ
Neatly, only on one side...

417
00:50:44,280 --> 00:50:50,580
行けどもけものみち 獅子よ虎よと吠え 赤ねさす空の 彼方にまほろば
Though we walk the beast's path, roaring like lions and tigers, toward the far-off blessed land under the red-tinted sky.

418
00:50:51,280 --> 00:50:58,280
幽囚の孤島に さまよう青春は 弱さと怒りが むき出しだけでいい
Youth wandering on an isolated island of captivity... raw weakness and anger are enough.

419
00:50:59,280 --> 00:51:04,580
父よ 未だ我は 己を知がたし
Father, I still do not yet truly know myself.

420
00:51:07,180 --> 00:51:14,480
先立つ兄らの 見えない背中を追えば 迷いの夜に明星は誘う
Chasing the unseen backs of the older brothers who went before me, the morning star invites me into the bewildered night.

421
00:51:21,880 --> 00:51:28,480
死して終わらぬ 夢を焦がれとも
Even yearning for a dream that doesn't end in death...

422
00:51:29,280 --> 00:51:36,580
確かな君こそ 我が命
You, who are certain, are my very life.

423
00:51:37,280 --> 00:51:44,580
烈風の荒野で 蝶よ花よと生き とこしえの春に 咲き添うまほろば
Living delicately like flowers and butterflies in a gale-swept wilderness, a blessed land blossoming alongside eternal spring.

424
00:51:45,180 --> 00:51:52,480
混濁の純潔 この身は汚れても 心の錦を 信じていてください
Even if this body is tainted in turbid purity, please believe in the brocade of my heart.

425
00:51:53,180 --> 00:52:02,380
母よ 決して我は 涙を見せねども 足下の草に露は消えませで
Mother, though I never show my tears, let the dew on the grass beneath my feet not vanish.

426
00:52:30,180 --> 00:52:35,280
交わらない キミとボク 今ゆくよ ボクは流れ星
You and I, who never intersect... Now I'm going, I am a shooting star.

427
00:52:47,280 --> 00:52:52,580
世界が朽ち果てても 変ることのないものがある
Even if the world rots and decays, there are things that will never change.

428
00:52:53,180 --> 00:52:58,580
涙をこらえてても 守るべきものが僕らにはある
Even holding back our tears, we have things we must protect.

429
00:52:59,280 --> 00:53:03,480
何万年何億年前からのメッセージが 体内でうずだき 鳴り響く
A message from tens of millions or hundreds of millions of years ago surges within our bodies and resounds.

430
00:53:04,280 --> 00:53:09,580
しゃがれた声で 明日を呼ぶ 傷だらけの手で 君守る
Calling out for tomorrow with a raspy voice, protecting you with scar-covered hands.

431
00:53:17,180 --> 00:53:24,580
見つめ合い 手と手を重ねて ガラス越しのキミとボク
Gazing at each other, overlapping hands, you and I across the glass.

432
00:53:25,180 --> 00:53:32,480
こんなにも側にいるのに 暗い闇を白黒に染めるよ
Even though we are so close, I will dye the dark gloom in monochrome.

433
00:53:34,180 --> 00:53:40,480
出口のない キミのもとへ 運命を切り裂く 流星
To you, who have no exit, a shooting star tearing through fate.

434
00:53:41,180 --> 00:53:45,580
あふれる君の涙 ボクがいま奪い去る
Your overflowing tears, I will snatch away right now.

435
00:53:50,280 --> 00:53:57,480
モザイクカケラ ひとつひとつ繋ぎ合わせて描いてゆく
Connecting mosaic pieces one by one as I paint them...

436
00:53:58,180 --> 00:54:05,480
あなたがくれた 出逢いと別れも
Even the meetings and partings you gave me...

437
00:54:14,280 --> 00:54:20,480
こんなはずじゃない そう思って眠り
Thinking 'This isn't how it should be,' I fall asleep.

438
00:54:21,280 --> 00:54:27,580
目覚めればいつもの 変わらない空回り
When I wake up, it's the same unchanging spinning wheels.

439
00:54:28,280 --> 00:54:34,480
意味も無く繰り返し
Repeating endlessly without meaning.

440
00:54:35,280 --> 00:54:42,480
モザイクカケラ 拾い集めてた「うまく生きる為の術」
Gathering up mosaic pieces, the 'arts of living well'.

441
00:54:43,280 --> 00:54:49,580
歪なソレが 美しく見えたんだ
That distorted thing looked so beautiful to me.

442
00:54:50,280 --> 00:54:57,480
強がりながら つまずきながら 選び抜いた道の上で
Acting tough, stumbling along, upon the path I chose.

443
00:54:58,280 --> 00:55:00,080
剥がれ落ちては 埋まらないカケラ
Fragments peeling away that cannot be refilled...

444
00:55:44,498 --> 00:55:48,638
はい、ということで、特報VTR見ていただきましたけれども
Right, so you've just seen the special report VTR,

445
00:55:48,888 --> 00:55:57,288
なんと、この鷹嶺ルイ、なんと、なんと、コードギアスアンバサダーに決定しましたー！
and amazingly, this Takane Lui has been appointed as the Code Geass Ambassador!

446
00:55:57,388 --> 00:56:00,888
やったー、嬉しい！ありがとうございます！
Yay, I'm so happy! Thank you so much!

447
00:57:37,888 --> 00:57:42,588
それではですね、新曲を披露させていただきます。よっ！
Now then, I will perform my new song. Here we go!

448
00:57:43,988 --> 00:57:51,588
ということで新曲のタイトルはですね、『ジグザグ』という曲になっております
So, the title of the new song is 'ZIG-ZAG'.

449
00:57:51,588 --> 00:58:03,088
ジグザグというのはですね、トラウマの別称になっているんですけれども、そのジグザグ……自分の中にあるトラウマと戦って、前を向いていこうという
'ZIG-ZAG' is another word for trauma, and it's a cool song about fighting the trauma within ourselves and moving forward.

450
00:58:27,588 --> 00:58:30,588
ルイ守り高嶺リヤが命ずる
Lui-guarding Takane Liya commands...

451
00:58:31,588 --> 00:58:33,888
お前たち、新曲を聴け！
You all, listen to the new song!

452
00:58:48,188 --> 00:58:49,288
ワン・ツー・スリー・フォー
One, two, three, four

453
00:58:57,688 --> 00:59:01,388
「幸せ」って囁いた問いがラッタラッタラッタ
Whispers of "happiness" lingering on, rat-ta-rat-ta-rat

454
00:59:01,788 --> 00:59:05,588
こびりついて離れんわ駄目だラッタラッタラッタ
Clinging and won't let go, no good, rat-ta-rat-ta-rat

455
00:59:06,088 --> 00:59:10,088
無味無臭の生活が思い出せないや
I can't even remember life without taste or smell anymore

456
00:59:10,388 --> 00:59:14,288
忘れたいから歌った馬鹿だラッタラッタラッタ
Singing because I want to forget, how foolish, rat-ta-rat-ta-rat

457
00:59:14,688 --> 00:59:22,588
恨む事も憎む事も賢く無い故出来なかった
I couldn't resent or hate because I wasn't smart enough

458
00:59:22,788 --> 00:59:31,088
これが君の結末ならば笑ってしまいたいほど笑ってしまいてい
If this is your ending, I want to laugh it off so much that I just...

459
00:59:35,288 --> 00:59:39,088
やだ痛い痛い痛いな奇跡とかちょっと望んじゃって
No, it hurts, it hurts, wishing a little for some miracle

460
00:59:39,388 --> 00:59:43,088
もう嫌嫌嫌嫌！タチが悪いわ
No more, no more! Such a bad habit

461
00:59:43,388 --> 00:59:47,588
ねえ辛い Lie Lie Lie 嘘？おかしいと全部えぐり取って
Hey, painful Lie Lie Lie, a lie? Ripping out everything bizarre

462
00:59:47,888 --> 00:59:51,588
薄情で結構好きに呼んでいいよ
Call me cold-hearted all you like

463
01:00:04,296 --> 01:00:08,596
私、甘え上手になれなかった 可愛いとかが足りなかった
I couldn't be good at being spoiled... I lacked cuteness and things like that.

464
01:00:09,196 --> 01:00:12,896
後悔が煩い夜だ
It's a night where regret is so noisy.

465
01:00:13,196 --> 01:00:20,596
過去は過去だと割り切っちゃえば？ きッとイイコトあるさとか それくらい百も承知だラッタッタ
"Just write off the past as the past?" "There's bound to be good things coming!" I know that a hundred times over, rattatta!

466
01:00:21,096 --> 01:00:29,596
願う事も祈る事も 許されないから黒く染めた
Since neither wishing nor praying was allowed, I dyed it all black.

467
01:00:30,096 --> 01:00:40,596
元の色も思い出せない 絡んだ運命の糸糸糸糸
I can't even remember the original color—tangled threads of fate, thread, thread, thread...

468
01:00:41,096 --> 01:00:49,096
やだ 痛い痛い痛いな 悲劇のヒロイン気取っちゃって もう嫌嫌嫌嫌 諦めっ ちゃえば？
No, it hurts, hurts, hurts, playing the tragic heroine. Just give up already, won't you?

469
01:00:49,596 --> 01:01:03,596
でも会いたい会いたいな 思考回路がこんががっちゃって 明日またきっと壊すけどいいの トラウマさえ愛おしいのですででででです
But I want to meet you, want to meet you, my thought circuits are all tangled up. It's fine if I break it all again tomorrow—even my trauma is precious, desu-desu-desu-desu-desu!

470
01:01:04,096 --> 01:01:09,596
夢の中で君と手を繋いでいるの
Holding hands with you inside a dream...

471
01:01:10,096 --> 01:01:16,596
何も知らないあの頃の二人のままで
Staying just like the two of us back then, knowing nothing at all.

472
01:01:17,096 --> 01:01:26,596
でもわかっているよ すぐに覚めてしまうと それならばいっそ君の手でそっと 止め刺してほら今今今！
But I know full well it will soon wake up. If so, then rather, with your own hands, quietly finish me off—look, right now, now, now!

473
01:01:27,096 --> 01:01:33,596
ほら今今今！
Look, right now, now, now!

474
01:01:34,096 --> 01:01:40,596
やだ 痛い痛い痛いな 奇跡とかちょっと望んじゃって もう嫌嫌嫌嫌 タチが悪いわ
No, it hurts, hurts, hurts, hoping just a bit for a miracle. I hate it, hate it, hate it, I've got such a bad disposition.

475
01:01:41,096 --> 01:01:50,096
ねぇ 辛い Lie Lie Lie 否？ おかしいと全部えぐり取って 薄情で結構 好きに呼んでいいよ
Hey, painful, Lie, Lie, Lie, No? Scoop out everything that's weird. Call me cold-hearted all you want, you can call me whatever you like.

476
01:01:50,596 --> 01:02:03,596
トラウマにバイバイしたいのですででででです
I want to say bye-bye to my trauma, desu-desu-desu-desu-desu!

477
01:02:19,596 --> 01:02:20,296
嘘っ
Lies...

478
01:02:36,946 --> 01:02:42,596
楽しくお届けしてきましたミュージックガーデン！あっという間にエンディングの時間となりました！
We've brought you a fun-filled Music Garden! Before you know it, it's time for the ending!

479
01:02:42,596 --> 01:02:44,896
ポルカ今日はどうでしたか？
Polka, how was it today?

480
01:02:44,996 --> 01:02:49,096
いやー なんか今日は私も一緒に歌って踊っちゃったからねえ
Man, today I ended up singing and dancing right along with everyone, you know.

481
01:02:49,196 --> 01:02:52,596
いつも以上にボルテージが上がっちゃったねえ
The voltage went up even more than usual!

482
01:02:52,596 --> 01:02:53,096
ああー
Yeah...

483
01:02:53,096 --> 01:02:57,096
あともう１時間！え、やらないですけども、もっとやりたいんですけどね
And one more hour! Ah, we're not going to do that, but I'd love to do even more!

484
01:02:57,196 --> 01:03:02,596
グッズ販売とプレミアム公開も迫ってますので！ あ、そうかそうか！
Because the merch sales and premiere are coming up! Ah, is that so, is that so!

485
01:03:02,896 --> 01:03:05,596
いや鷹嶺、今日は天候も盛りだったねえ
Man, Takane, today the atmosphere was really lively too.

486
01:03:05,696 --> 01:03:07,596
まさかこんなぎゃす……
To think that this kind of geass...

487
01:03:07,596 --> 01:03:09,596
ためてるためてる！
You're holding it back, you're holding it back!

488
01:03:09,596 --> 01:03:22,596
私もね、早く言いたくて言いたくてたまらなかったです。この後グッズ販売と新曲プレミアム公開、そしてメンバーシップ限定配信もありますので、楽しんでいただけたら嬉しいです。
I also really, really wanted to announce it sooner. After this, we have merchandise sales, the new song premiere, and a membership-exclusive stream, so I'd be happy if you all enjoy them.

489
01:03:22,596 --> 01:03:25,596
本当にこの後も盛りだくさんだ！改めてお誕生日おめでとうね！
There's so much more after this! Once again, happy birthday!

490
01:03:25,596 --> 01:03:31,596
ありがとうございます！ミュージックガーデン2できて本当に嬉しいです。ポルカさんもフブキさんも、本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you very much! I'm truly happy that Music Garden 2 could happen. Polka-san, Fubuki-san, thank you both so much!

491
01:03:31,696 --> 01:03:32,296
いやーありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

492
01:03:32,396 --> 01:03:33,596
本当にこの後も盛りだくさんで
There's really so much more ahead...

493
01:03:33,596 --> 01:03:37,096
あずきね、またまたやりたいね！ まあ是非またやりたいですね。
Azuki... wait, we want to do it again! Well, we definitely want to do it again.

494
01:03:37,096 --> 01:03:38,596
よろしくお願いします！
Please look forward to it!

495
01:03:38,696 --> 01:03:42,596
せっかくですので、ゲストの皆さんにも感想をいただきましょう！皆さんから何か言いたいことがあるみたいですよ。
Since we have the chance, let's get some thoughts from our guests too! It seems everyone has something they'd like to say.

496
01:03:43,096 --> 01:03:46,096
おお！ ルイ！
Oh! Lui!

497
01:03:46,896 --> 01:03:53,596
お誕生日おめでとー！うわー！ありがとうございます！
Happy birthday! Woohoo! Thank you very much!

498
01:03:54,096 --> 01:03:59,596
みんなと歌えて幸せでした！またコラボしようね！
I was so happy to sing with everyone! Let's collaborate again!

499
01:04:00,096 --> 01:04:06,596
はい、では本当にあっと言う間ですが、今夜のミュージックガーデンはここまでとなります！ありがとうございましたー！
Yes, so truly time flies, but tonight's Music Garden concludes here! Thank you very much!

500
01:04:06,596 --> 01:04:10,596
それじゃあまたMUSIC GARDEN 3が叶う日まで！ さようならー！さようならー！
Until the day MUSIC GARDEN 3 can happen! Goodbye! Goodbye!

501
01:04:10,896 --> 01:04:13,596
さようならー！and YOU！
Goodbye! And YOU!

502
01:05:00,198 --> 01:05:01,988
素敵なせーのっでポストカードがつくぞ！
With a wonderful "one, two," you get a postcard!

503
01:05:02,158 --> 01:05:03,178
な、なっ…てぇ！
W-What...?!

504
01:05:03,278 --> 01:05:05,208
さらにホロカもついてくる。
Plus, HoloCa comes with it too!

505
01:05:07,018 --> 01:05:08,668
これは買いでしょ！
This is a must-buy!

506
01:05:10,254 --> 01:05:34,256
[Title: MUSIC GARDEN ▶ TAKANE LUI Birthday 2025 重大告知あり!!]
[Title: MUSIC GARDEN ▶ TAKANE LUI Birthday 2025 Major Announcements Included!!]

